{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Where is this shop of yours?": "",
  "It's on the north side of Senryo Avenue. You can look it up on the map.": "",
  "Got it. I'll head over there the moment I'm free.": "",
  "Good, I'll be waiting for you.": "",
  "(So I'm working for Koizuka the locksmith now. That's a thing. Guess I'll head over there whenever I have some time.)": "",
  "Okay, Koizuka-san. I made it.": "",
  "Excellent. I already have some jobs lined up for you.": "",
  "Pick whichever one you like.": "",
  "All right, it's in your hands now.": "",
  "You'll get paid when the job is done, so make sure to report back to me.": "",
  "Got it. I'll get going then.": "",
  "Hm? You're not working after all?": "",
  "Then come back when you do have some time.": "",
  "Looks like it went smoothly, Yagami-kun. I got a call from the client just now.": "",
  "I managed to do it somehow.": "",
  "Well, here's your payment for today.": "",
  "You're pretty good at what you do. I'll be counting on you again!": "",
  "Heard you did well, Yagami-kun. You're shaping up to be one heck of a locksmith! Maybe even a professional.": "",
  "Ah, I wouldn't say that...": "",
  "Why don't you quit being a detective and make this your career? ...Haha, I'm only joking!": "",
  "I'll be counting on you in the near future!": "",
  "(Now, I know I owe Tomioka-san a pretty hefty sum... But I need this cash to survive.)": "",
  "(I do plan on paying her back someday... I'm sure she'll understand.)": "",
  "Looks like everything went smoothly, Yagami-kun. I got a thank-you call from our client just now.": "",
  "Oh, really? That's great.": "",
  "Thanks for all your hard work!": "",
  "Oh, are you the locksmith? Good. It's this door right here...": "",
  "Thank you! If it weren't for you, I'd be totally stuck...": "",
  "No sweat. Take care now.": "",
  "(I need to report back to Koizuka-san if I want to get paid.)": "",
  "Is... something the matter?": "",
  "O-Oh, I accidentally forgot one of my tools... I'll be right back.": "",
  "\"Accidentally\" huh?": "",
  "(This is a little too complex... I'll come back another time.)": "",
  "Are you the locksmith I called? Can you handle this door?": "",
  "Oh, awesome. Thanks.": "",
  "Hi. Could you get this door open, please?": "",
  "You did it! Thank you so much.": "",
  "You're the locksmith, right? I need this opened right away.": "",
  "Ah, there we go. Thanks for that.": "",
  "There some kind of issue here? I need this door opened ASAP.": "",
  "I've been waiting for you. Can you open this for me?": "",
  "Thanks! You're a real lifesaver.": "",
  "What, is this too difficult for you?": "",
  "N-No, I accidentally forgot one of my tools... I'll be right back.": "",
  "This doorknob's tougher than a slab of meat. Think you can bust it open for me?": "",
  "Are you struggling? Because it totally looks like you are.": "",
  "Oh good, you must be the locksmith! Please, can you get this open?": "",
  "You're so talented! Thank you.": "",
  "You... can't actually open this, can you?": "",
  "Sorry to drag you out here... I kind of locked myself out. Can you help me?": "",
  "Whew! Thank you so much for coming.": "",
  "Is it impossible to open or something?": "",
  "Oh, you're the locksmith. Then would you mind opening this for me?": "",
  "Thank you! I knew it was the right choice to call you!": "",
  "Everything okay over here?": "",
  "I see. I'll be waiting then.": "",
  "Are you the locksmith? Um... It's this door, right over here.": "",
  "Ooh, wow! Just like that, huh? Thank you!": "",
  "Huh. I never imagined this would be too difficult for even a professional to handle.": "",
  "N-No, it's... I accidentally forgot one of my tools... I'll be right back.": "",
  "Okay. I'll be waiting then.": "",
  "Ah, the locksmith man. How about you open this door for me?": "",
  "...What? Hurry up and get crackin' on this thing.": "",
  "Uh. Is there a reason you're wearing that over your head?": "",
  "I beg your pardon?": "",
  "You're... not about to rob this place, are you?": "",
  "...D-Don't be ridiculous! In fact, that's defamation of character! I could sue!": "",
  "If you did, it would end very badly for you. Take it from me.": "",
  "O-Okay, well... I'm actually wearing this because I'm doing an escape room! Yeah! I came back for some of my gear!": "",
  "Then I realized I lost my keys, so naturally I decided to call a locksmith. See, my story checks out!": "",
  "Your \"story,\" huh?": "",
  "Ahh! I can still see it! That look of doubt in your eyes! It wounds me!": "",
  "Please, Mister Locksmith Man! <font_kind=yakuza_italic>Please believe me</font_kind>! I need to get this door open and I'm running out of time!": "",
  "*sigh* All right...": "",
  "Oh, you were marvelous! The way you worked your way around that knob... I'll remember you!": "",
  "(...Was it really okay to open that, though?)": "",
  "This is taking forever! Can't you just open it already?": "",
  "Now you're making excuses, huh? Well, hurry up and get it then!": "",
  "Oh, do you want to do a quick job? These are all the jobs I've got so far...": "",
  "I'll send the client's location to the map on your phone, so head to where the key icon is.": "",
  "Hey, are you all right?": "",
  "N-Ngh...": "",
  "Need... mugwort...": "",
  "Mugwort?": "",
  "You mean this?": "",
  "Yes. Now can you place that mugwort into the gourd right there?": "",
  "Just stuff it in, close the lid, and shake it.": "",
  "A-All right...": "",
  "Whew. Now I'm feeling much better.": "",
  "Glad to hear it, old-timer. What was in that drink just now?": "",
  "Oh, this? I call this an extract.": "",
  "An extract... of what?": "",
  "Technically speaking, this is a medicinal decoction... but \"extract\" rolls much easier off the tongue, does it not?": "",
  "Oh, but forgive me for not introducing myself. I'm Iyama. I make and market my own extracts right here in Kamurocho.": "",
  "That's why people call me the Hermit of the Dragon's Palace.": "",
  "Huh. People just call me Yagami. What's this Dragon's Palace thing about? ": "",
  "You know that abandoned building in the Hotel District? That's the Dragon's Palace. My pharmacy's on the 4th floor.": "",
  "A pharmacy... So that mugwort was one of your ingredients?": "",
  "Yes. I came here to gather ingredients for an extract I'm making, but I got winded and ended up taking a nasty fall.": "",
  "I'm glad you were around. Otherwise I might not have made it.": "",
  "(I just met a man, who is apparently a hermit, that makes drugs in an abandoned building. That's not strange at all.)": "",
  "Well, if it isn't Yagami! Ready to die, punk!?": "",
  "Ugh... the Keihin Gang. Of course.": "",
  "Hey! Get your ass over here!": "",
  "Whoa... Where'd they find this freak of nature?": "",
  "Now! Go get Yagami... and break him!": "",
  "What the hell's with this guy... it's like he's invincible!": "",
  "Ahah! Ahahahaha! Looks like you don't even have a fraction of his strength!": "",
  "It seems you've gotten yourself into quite the pickle, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Iyama-san... You shouldn't be here right now.": "",
  "Now hold your horses. I want to at least pay you back for your help earlier, so I brought you a little something.": "",
  "One of my miraculous homebrewed extracts, of course. Once you drink it... well, you'll find out soon enough.": "",
  "You done chitchatting with your hobo friend over there!? Hurry up and fight me, asshole!": "",
  "Oh no! I'm all out of juice!": "",
  "What're you floundering around for? Here, have some more.": "",
  "Sorry. I'll get him this time for sure...": "",
  "You done trying to weasel your way out of our fight, Yagami!? Get your ass over here!": "",
  "All right, sheesh. Don't rush me.": "",
  "W-What the shit!?": "",
  "So... this is the power of your extract...": "",
  "How was that? Pretty darn effective, wouldn't you say?": "",
  "Yeah. I had no idea it would be this potent...": "",
  "My back is killing me... Even these extracts of mine can't fix old age, it seems.": "",
  "You think you'll be okay? If not, I can always give you a lift back to the Dragon's Palace.": "",
  "No thanks. I wouldn't want you to go out of your way like that.": "",
  "It's fine, I was actually planning on going that way. Don't let it trouble you.": "",
  "Whoa... What is all this...?": "",
  "Why don't you have a seat?": "",
  "(Is this some kind of stew? ...Ugh, it totally reeks! What the hell did he put in here...?)": "",
  "Ah, curious about my hot pot, are you? Well, this would be the liquid base of our extract.": "",
  "You mean this weird stew?": "",
  "Correct. That stew contains a special broth that, when mixed with the right ingredients, turns into the extract.": "",
  "These extracts are specifically concocted to draw out the essence of each ingredient and transfer that power into the body.": "",
  "You mean like when I drank it during that fight?": "",
  "Indeed. Now listen close.": "",
  "See how there are many types of extracts here? Each one requires a different set of ingredients.": "",
  "You can find all the ingredients you need by looking around the city. All you need to do is add them to the broth and you're done.": "",
  "That doesn't sound too hard.": "",
  "Nope. In fact, I have just enough ingredients to make another extract. Why not try it out for yourself?": "",
  "(Well, it never hurts to try. Let's do this.)": "",
  "Looks like it's just about ready. Bring the ingredients over here.": "",
  "Here. I'll give you a little recipe that details everything an extract might need.": "",
  "If you want to try your hand at brewing more extracts, then go gather some ingredients.": "",
  "Also, take this gourd. It's filled with a special solution that allows you to brew your own extracts at any time.": "",
  "Um. Why does this recipe say \"Scavenger Hunt\" on it?": "",
  "Oh yeah, I forgot to tell you. There are errands I'd like you to run.": "",
  "I'm trying to develop as many new extracts as possible, so I'd like your help with collecting the right ingredients.": "",
  "If you make me the extract listed on this recipe, I'll teach you how to brew more.": "",
  "But for now, get to scavenging. Hope it all goes well.": "",
  "(Whoa. He actually has customers?)": "",
  "Iyama-san, do you have anything that'll help me feel more energetic?": "",
  "Hey, lemme get the one I had the other day, yeah?": "",
  "Here you are. Plenty of extracts to go around, now.": "",
  "Mmm, come to papa!": "",
  "Here you go, Iyama-san. I brought the extract you wanted.": "",
  "Ahh, well done. You must've worked very hard to put all this together.": "",
  "Is this really considered an extract, though? All I did was gather a bunch of random junk.": "",
  "Well, since we can't forage for natural ingredients, like bugs and plants, in the middle of a huge city...": "",
  "...We'll have to make do with items that, essentially, contain the same components.": "",
  "Oh. I guess that makes sense.": "",
  "I'm aware that what I asked you for might seem suspicious, but let me assure you that the recipe is 100% genuine.": "",
  "All right. Now let's try making an extract with the ingredients you came up with.": "",
  "Here we are. It's done.": "",
  "As promised, I'll give you the recipe for the new extract. Try making it once you gather the ingredients.": "",
  "I'll hand you the new Scavenger Hunt list as well. I'm sure you'll find it useful one way or another.": "",
  "I think you should take this too. Go on.": "",
  "And this is?": "",
  "It's a gourd filled with my special broth. If you pack the ingredients in here, you can brew your own extracts anytime.": "",
  "Wow, I had no idea something like this even existed.": "",
  "Yep. Feel free to bring me the completed extract itself, or just the raw ingredients. I'll mark it complete either way.": "",
  "Thanks for the delivery, Yagami-san. My research is going smoothly thanks to you.": "",
  "As promised, I'll give you the new recipe.": "",
  "Also, I'll give you the new Scavenger Hunt I'd like you to do.": "",
  "You know, the more I learn about these extracts, the stranger I think they are. What's the science behind them?": "",
  "To be perfectly honest... I have no idea.": "",
  "Yeah. I've researched modern medicine and folk medicine from all over the world, too...": "",
  "And it seems these extracts I make are based on something completely different from all known pharmacology.": "",
  "So, it's like... an alien form of medicine or something? That's wild.": "",
  "Well, it might be. But one thing I know for sure is: it really works wonders for your health.": "",
  "It's got to the point where I've had lines out the door for my medicine. Especially by yakuza and the homeless.": "",
  "Understandable. This stuff is pretty potent. I don't think a doctor would ever come up with anything like this.": "",
  "Yagami-san. If it weren't for you, I never would've got this far in developing my extracts.": "",
  "As promised, I'll give you this final recipe.": "",
  "You don't need me to do any more scavenger hunts?": "",
  "This should be enough. And wouldn't you know it, I've even made some headway in researching the original recipe.": "",
  "Did you find out what happened in your past?": "",
  "Unfortunately, I haven't discovered much.": "",
  "But I am starting to believe... my parents were actually <font_kind=yakuza_italic>tengu</font_kind>.": "",
  "What? You mean those ogre-type creatures that live up in the mountains? I thought they were only a fairy tale.": "",
  "Well, I was discovered in the remotest of remote mountains. Plus I had this recipe for medicine that no one's ever seen.": "",
  "Not only that, but the effects of these extracts are nigh supernatural. Even I can't explain it, and I make them!": "",
  "So, I figure it either has to be the work of tengu or some other kind of mountain god. Or aliens, like you said.": "",
  "Haha, well... It's hard to dismiss those claims, especially after seeing the extracts work their magic.": "",
  "Even so, I still have no idea who my parents are. The only family I've ever known are these Dragon's Palace denizens.": "",
  "I initially thought of this as a temporary housing situation that I somehow got stuck with...": "",
  "But now, whenever someone asks me who I am... I find myself saying, \"the Hermit of the Dragon's Palace.\"": "",
  "Maybe if your extracts become widespread, the tengu who raised you will hear about it and finally show up.": "",
  "Hahaha, talk about divine intervention! But they do say faith can move mountains...": "",
  "Thanks for the delivery, Yagami-san. My research on these extracts is going smoothly thanks to you.": "",
  "By the way, what made you research this medicine in the first place, Iyama-san?": "",
  "Hmm... I wonder.... if I had to pinpoint a particular reason...": "",
  "I suppose it would be to understand myself?": "",
  "...What do you mean by that?": "",
  "I don't have any family, you see. The earliest memory I have is being abandoned in the mountains.": "",
  "So, if I really think about it, I actually have no idea where I was born or who I even am. Crazy, right?": "",
  "That is crazy...": "",
  "But when I was rescued, I did have one thing on me: an old, crumpled-up piece of paper...": "",
  "And on it was written the recipe... for the mysterious extracts.": "",
  "Whoa. So the extract was the first thing you knew.": "",
  "Yes. It is the only connection I've ever had to my true past... Maybe that's why I'm working so hard to research it.": "",
  "(Even his origins are mysterious...)": "",
  "Aghhh... Ughhh...": "",
  "(What's that old man doing lying on the ground? Is he... okay?)": "",
  "There should be some growing just behind that fence. Sorry, but could you grab some for me?": "",
  "Are you sure? Then I'll take you up on your offer...": "",
  "Extracts can have a variety of different effects depending on the one you make.": "",
  "(Well, Hoshino-kun is waiting. I should head to Charles.)": "",
  "Yagami-san, about the extract ingredient I asked you to get...": "",
  "If you're looking for an empty energy drink bottle, I see these often on Pink Street.": "",
  "If you're looking for a small branch, I see 'em all the time on on Park Boulevard.": "",
  "Once you have the necessary ingredients, brew the extract and bring it to me.": "",
  "Need me to brew some extracts? I'll sell you anything I've brewed so far.": "",
  "As thanks for saving me, I'll give you the key to the Dragon's Palace, so feel free to come by when you want.": "",
  "Oh, thanks...": "",
  "The Dragon's Palace has a nice casino and gambling hall, so swing on by if you're looking to get away for a while.": "",
  "Wow, sounds like there's all kinds of stuff over there.": "",
  "Woargh...": "",
  "(Oops... Almost forgot. I need to go help that old man.)": "",
  "Greetings, sir. Would you care to see some breasts today?": "",
  "I'm talking some world-class lady loaves here. Knockers that will knock your socks off. Some incredible inflatables.": "",
  "Wait a minute... Yosuke-kun?": "",
  "Oh! Y-Yagami-san!?": "",
  "What the hell were you just asking me?": "",
  "Oh, uh, ahahaha. You see, I'm actually working part-time as a barker.": "",
  "I thought you were supposed to be a student.": "",
  "I am. In fact, I'm going to a vocational school right now.": "",
  "Well, then why is a vocational school student working as a barker?": "",
  "Oh, a lot of us students do this kind of work. It's easy and it pays well, you know?": "",
  "That may be true, but I must say... I'm not all that impressed with your career choice.": "",
  "Hey now... This is actually a very important job. A noble undertaking, even!": "",
  "So, I will ask once more. Are you ready to witness the honkiest hooter experience you've ever had in your life?": "",
  "Dude, do these terrible names work on other guys? They're certainly not working on me.": "",
  "Wait, there's actually a reason why I'm doing this! Call it a greater purpose if you will! I'll even beg if I have to!": "",
  "(Well he does seem be pretty earnest about this... Should I just play along?)": "",
  "(No, I'm busy right now.)": "",
  "Sorry, but I'm a little too busy to be gawking at a lady's chest.": "",
  "But, if you ever feel the urge to satisfy your visual needs, please come back and let your pal Yosuke show you the way!": "",
  "Ah, Yagami-san. Perhaps the lacteous call of cleavage beckons your return?": "",
  "(He said he had some kind of reason for doing this. Should I just play along?)": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "I beg your pardon?": "อะไรนะครับ?",
  "Hey, are you all right?": "เฮ้ ไม่เป็นไรใช่ไหม",
  "N-Ngh...": "อ-อึก...",
  "A-All right...": "ได้...ได้ครับ...",
  "And this is?": "แล้วนี่คืออะไร?",
  "That is crazy...": "บ้าสุดๆ ไปเลย..."
 }
}
